<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: 等线 Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: 等线;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4472C4;  --docx-accent2-color: #ED7D31;  --docx-accent3-color: #A5A5A5;  --docx-accent4-color: #FFC000;  --docx-accent5-color: #5B9BD5;  --docx-accent6-color: #70AD47;  --docx-hlink-color: #0563C1;  --docx-folhlink-color: #954F72;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx p, p.docx_a {  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;  text-indent: 10.00pt;  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_a span {  font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}p.docx_1 {  text-indent: 0.00pt;  text-align: center;  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;}p.docx_1 span {  font-family: 方正小标宋简体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 22.00pt;  font-size: 22.00pt;}p.docx_1 span {  font-family: 方正小标宋简体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 22.00pt;  font-size: 22.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_a1 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}span.docx_10 {  font-family: 方正小标宋简体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 22.00pt;  font-size: 22.00pt;}span.docx_10 p {  text-indent: 0.00pt;  text-align: center;  min-height: 28pt;  line-height: 28pt;}span.docx_10 {  font-family: 方正小标宋简体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 22.00pt;  font-size: 22.00pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p class="docx_1" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">2026级相关本科新生：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">入学能力测试定于2026年9月2日（星期三）进行，相关要求提醒如下：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">一、考试时间、地点及科目</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">9:00～11:00 &nbsp;英语 &nbsp; &nbsp;14:00～15:30 &nbsp;数学</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">16:00～17:30 &nbsp;物理（仅选考物理的学生参加）</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">具体考场安排见一站式网上办事大厅“我的考试安排”，请提前打印考试准考证（操作方法详见附件）。建议将考试安排截图保存，以备不时之需。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">二、考试时，考生须携带本人的身份证（或一卡通）及准考证。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">三、请考生提前准备2B铅笔、橡皮、直尺与黑色签字笔等文具。英语科目听力部分使用电台实施，工作频率为86.6MHz，请携带头戴式调频一体式耳机参加考试，提前备足电池，保证耳机正常工作。8月31日至9月1日，每日8:30-17:30可进行听力试听。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">四、考试期间，学生须遵守考场纪律。无故迟到15分钟以上者，不得参加考试；开考30分钟后才允许交卷出场。考试过程中自觉服从监考人员管理。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">附件：新生入学能力测试准考证打印操作指南</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;"><br></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;"><br></span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; margin-right: 64pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">本科生院 &nbsp; </span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; margin-right: 64pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;">2026年8月28日</span></p></article></section><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-indent: 0pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;"><br></span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
